id: pm-gh1392
title: "GH-1392: Keep extension diagnostics read-only and resolve npm-managed freshness"
description: The report describes extension manage changing the tracked managed-state timestamp/order and skipping npm update checks. It also reports bare-name reinstall failing to reuse the recorded npm source. Existing truthful partial-coverage semantics must remain intact.
